WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.031
On new-release day, open Ordering → Received.

2
00:00:05.031 --> 00:00:11.153
Every title out this week is listed, with the copies customers reserved and the store ordered.

3
00:00:11.153 --> 00:00:15.173
Only titles with copies coming hides the rest.

4
00:00:15.173 --> 00:00:20.846
Tick what came in: Tick all shown, then untick anything that didn’t arrive.

5
00:00:20.846 --> 00:00:25.986
Then Mark … ready. Customers see their books as ready for pickup.

6
00:00:25.986 --> 00:00:32.231
Re-order is for titles past their cutoff, like trades that stay in print.
